BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Sketching with Sami
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T120000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a481f6edd4fa0c68b5eb3a0@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Come join Sami as we sketch the local plants in Holbrook-Palme
 r Park. Together\, we can learn more about what is blooming locally\, so t
 hat when we take walks outside in the future\, we will be able to recogniz
 e what is growing alongside us. Some techniques that will be taught by Sam
 i include how to sketch flowers and how to mix watercolors so that they ap
 pear more natural."\n\nSpace is limited\, and registration is required. Re
 gistrants will be emailed the exact location in Holbrook-Palmer Park.\n\nA
 ges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRe
 gistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481f
 6edd4fa0c68b5eb3a0\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481f6edd4fa0c68b5eb3a0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Financial Literacy Workshop: Ten Steps to Financial Success
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T193000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a88ba2b4cb69d003e2267ff@local-events
DESCRIPTION:We all measure financial success differently\, but all paths t
 o get there require discipline and goals. This session teaches participant
 s ways to financial control— including developing a spending plan\, cre
 ating objectives\, weighing insurance needs\, and other tools that will he
 lp get on the road to personal financial success.\n\nRegistration is recom
 mended but not required.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along
 \, not designed for them)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bi
 bliocommons.com/events/6a88ba2b4cb69d003e2267ff\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 0
 9:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a88ba2b4cb69d003e2267ff
END:VEVENT
