BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Drop-In Sewing Machine Basics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T140000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a95e0b829a7dd0d674809f0@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Interested in picking up the fun life skill of sewing? Not sur
 e how to get started? Our Drop-in Sewing Machine Basics session will be pe
 rfect for you! You’ll be guided on all the basics of using a Baby Lock J
 ubilant machine. From winding a bobbin\, threading the machine\, to runnin
 g some simple stitches. We’ll help you learn some best practices and gai
 n skills that you can use on future projects. No registration is required
 \, but sewing machines and space are limited. \n\nDrop-In Sewing Machine 
 Basics is for adults 18 and older only. \n\nIf you are 6 to 18 years old
 \, you are welcome to register for Jr. Sewing\, which occurs every third T
 uesday of the month.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, n
 ot designed for them)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.biblio
 commons.com/events/6a95e0b829a7dd0d674809f0\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46
  PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a95e0b829a7dd0d674809f0
END:VEVENT
