BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Fall Restorative Yoga & Sound Healing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T193000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a90d13a36204e08fbb7c1fd@local-events
DESCRIPTION:As some head back to school\, others start the Fall push to fi
 nish projects before year end. Take a moment to pause and ground with this
  restorative practice. Come join us at the Library to listen to the sounds
  of Alchemy and Tibetan bowls. As you rest in the restorative poses you wi
 ll ground\, center and refocus. Take time and gift yourself this moment to
  renew your energies! No prior yoga experience is necessary. Please bring 
 a yoga mat\, blanket and bolster. We will have some supplies if you need. 
 Due to high demand\, we ask that community members sign up for a single oc
 currence of this series so that as many community members can participate 
 in this experience as possible.\n\nSpace is limited\, and registration is 
 required. Signups will open on Tuesday\, September 22 at 10:00am.\n\nAges
 : Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRegis
 tration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a90d13a3
 6204e08fbb7c1fd\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a90d13a36204e08fbb7c1fd
END:VEVENT
