DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T190000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a481b07e3c2e3fd937c2b17@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Aprende y practica inglés en una clase presencial y acogedora
  en la Biblioteca de Atherton. Desarrolla tus habilidades de expresión or
 al\, comprensión auditiva\, lectura y escritura para la vida diaria con u
 n instructor certificado. Todos los niveles son bienvenidos!\n____________
 ________________\nLearn and practice English in a welcoming\, in-person cl
 ass at the Atherton Library. Build your speaking\, listening\, reading\, a
 nd writing skills for everyday life with a certified instructor. All level
 s are welcome!\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not des
 igned for them)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommon
 s.com/events/6a481b07e3c2e3fd937c2b17\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481b07e3c2e3fd937c2b17
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Sketching with Sami
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260914T120000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a481f6edd4fa0c68b5eb39e@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Come join Sami as we sketch the local plants in Holbrook-Palme
 r Park. Together\, we can learn more about what is blooming locally\, so t
 hat when we take walks outside in the future\, we will be able to recogniz
 e what is growing alongside us. Some techniques that will be taught by Sam
 i include how to sketch flowers and how to mix watercolors so that they ap
 pear more natural."\n\nSpace is limited\, and registration is required. Re
 gistrants will be emailed the exact location in Holbrook-Palmer Park.\n\nA
 ges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRe
 gistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481f
 6edd4fa0c68b5eb39e\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481f6edd4fa0c68b5eb39e
END:VEVENT
