SUMMARY:[ATH] Day of the Dead: Mini Ofrendas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T130000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:smcl-6a9a6c9fbe148200298c6de3@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Build your own mini altar to celebrate Day of the Dead! Local 
 artist Elizabeth Jiménez Montelongo will guide you through the process\, 
 demonstrating each step. She will also share some information on basic alt
 ar elements and the Indigenous roots of the tradition. There is opportunit
 y for creative liberty and personalization of this project.\n\nMaterials: 
 Please bring your choice of three empty boxes in various sizes: cereal box
 es\, shoe boxes\, tissue boxes\, snack boxes. Other materials will be pro
 vided. Feel free to bring small decorative objects\, natural objects\, an
 d/or a photo or focal item for the top.\n\nRegistration will open on Tuesd
 ay\, October 13 at 6:00 PM.\n\nAges: Adult program (kids welcome to tag al
 ong\, not designed for them)\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl
 .bibliocommons.com/events/6a9a6c9fbe148200298c6de3\nLast synced: 2026-09-0
 4 09:46 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a9a6c9fbe148200298c6de3
END:VEVENT
