UID:smcl-6a90c47e60ccaf01c0218d5d@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Come capture the magic of the twilight hours at the Atherton L
 ibrary with soft pastels and gel pens. Create beautiful panels that show t
 he enchanting transformation from dusk to the wee hours of the morning. Th
 is workshop is self-lead with staff and volunteers providing tips and tric
 ks. \n\nRegistration is recommended but not required.\n\nAges: Adult prog
 ram (kids welcome to tag along\, not designed for them)\nRegistration: req
